    "deepfluoro_reference_proxy": "s=(reference-ROI_min)/(ROI_max-ROI_min), clipped to [0,1]; proxy=log(2/(1+s))/log(2), following xvr log-linearization with an explicit final unit scale; not calibrated attenuation",
